# Accepted-risk register for image scanning. Every entry needs a reason and
# an owner decision; entries are revisited when the base image updates.
#
# The four findings below are Go-module vulnerabilities compiled into the
# upstream FrankenPHP/Caddy binary (usr/local/bin/frankenphp). We already
# build from the latest v1 alpine tag, so no upstream fix is available to
# pull yet. The vulnerable component (kin-openapi ValidationHandler /
# related Caddy toolchain modules) is not part of this application's
# request path: the app serves plain Laravel routes and does not enable
# Caddy's OpenAPI validation or admin modules. Risk accepted until the
# base image ships fixed modules; tracked for re-review on each base bump.
